WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.267
Language models are typically trained for a single
epoch over vast corpora to avoid overfitting.

00:00:06.347 --> 00:00:11.226
Computer vision rarely has that luxury: many tasks
have only tiny datasets,

00:00:11.306 --> 00:00:14.796
so the language training schedule does not carry over.

00:00:14.876 --> 00:00:19.358
At the same time, the community keeps scaling model
and dataset size,

00:00:19.438 --> 00:00:23.060
while classical remedies for scarce and imbalanced data,

00:00:23.140 --> 00:00:26.498
namely data augmentation and knowledge distillation,

00:00:26.578 --> 00:00:30.465
have barely been tried in the autoregressive vision
setting.

00:00:30.545 --> 00:00:32.250
This paper closes that gap.
